# Receta de NaranjOS — generada por naranjos-tanda-6f4.sh
pkgname=dejagnu
pkgver=1.6.3
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc='Marco de pruebas DejaGnu'
arch=('any')
url='https://github.com/DYeicob/naranjos-recetas'
license=('GPL-3.0-or-later')
depends=('expect')
makedepends=()
source=('https://ftpmirror.gnu.org/dejagnu/dejagnu-1.6.3.tar.gz')
sha256sums=('87daefacd7958b4a69f88c6856dbd1634261963c414079d0c371f589cd66a2e3')
build() {
  cd dejagnu-$pkgver
  mkdir -p build && cd build
  ../configure --prefix=/usr
  makeinfo --html --no-split -o doc/dejagnu.html ../doc/dejagnu.texi
  makeinfo --plaintext       -o doc/dejagnu.txt  ../doc/dejagnu.texi
}
check() { cd dejagnu-$pkgver/build; make check || echo "dejagnu: alguna prueba falló"; }
package() {
  cd dejagnu-$pkgver/build
  make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
  install -d "$pkgdir/usr/share/doc/dejagnu-$pkgver"
  install -m644 doc/dejagnu.{html,txt} "$pkgdir/usr/share/doc/dejagnu-$pkgver"
}
